      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear understanding of the test. Let me write an improved version with better variable names and clearer structure.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version uses a descriptive variable name (`valueWithAllowGettersEnabled`), named boolean arguments via inline comments, and reorders the assertions so the key identity check (`assertSame`) comes first to immediately communicate the primary intent of the test."
